msgid ""
"Connect AI agents to your NewsBlur account via the Model Context Protocol. Read feeds, triage stories, "
"train classifiers, and manage subscriptions from Claude Code, Codex, or any MCP-compatible tool. 28 tools "
"available with pre-built prompt templates for common workflows like daily briefings and inbox triage."
